The list container is currently `grow overflow-auto … min-h-40`: because its flex‑basis is `auto` and there is no height cap, it expands with the folder count and pushes the whole modal into scrolling (daisyUI `.modal-box` has `overflow-y: auto`), so the header/actions scroll away. Replacing it with a fixed height + internal scroll makes the dialog size stable no matter how many folders exist.

